DESCRIPTION Allowed dependencies between the components of <System name>
CATEGORY Static Coupling
NAMESPACE <Id>StructureNS
DEFINE SYSTEM <System name> AS <id>
    DEFINE DOMAIN <Domain> AS <domain>
        DEFINE COMPONENT <Component A> AS <component-a>
        DEFINE COMPONENT <Component B> AS <component-b>
    DEFINE DATABASE <Domain> Database AS <domain>-db

# Dependencies: explicit, one rule per line, each with an ID that a test carries (rename SYS to your system)
ASSERT(<Component A> HAS NO DEPENDENCY ON <Component B>) # [SYS-S1]

# Data ownership
ASSERT(<Domain> Database is only accessed by <Component A>) # [SYS-D1]
